:: Gwylan Gifts List
<<effects>>

그윌란에게 어떤 선물을 줄까?
<br><br>

<<food_gift_list>>

<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
	<<skinicon "give">><<link [[선물 주기 (0:05)|Gwylan Gifts]]>><<pass 5>><<give_gift Gwylan>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
